# Build context is environment/ and only app/ is copied into the image. These
# patterns keep build artifacts and caches out of the context. (The task-root
# solution/ and tests/ live outside this context and are never sent here.)
.git
.gitignore
.env
*.log
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/build/
**/*.o
**/*.a
